            <div class="vt-related-content related-content_wrap rail-widget_wrap">
        <h2>Related Chapters</h2>

        <div class="widget-links_wrap">
                <div class="article-title">
                    <a href="https://www.emerald.com/books/edited-volume/21396/chapter/112099187/An-Empirical-Analysis-on-Exploring-Sustainable">An Empirical Analysis on Exploring Sustainable Development Goals Through Nature-based Health Tourism in India</a>
